+### [Application-Specific Pipelines](11200-application-specific-pipelines.md)
+This category encompasses the general strategy of adapting NeRF for domain-specific inverse problems. It serves as the conceptual parent for the specific implementations below, defining the common architectural and optimization modifications described in [Shared principles](#shared-principles).
